  "body": "**Blocked by:** #1152\n**Model tier:** high\n\n## Context\nModel tier rationale: This change establishes a cross-process routing and execution contract with failure and concurrency paths.\nThe user approved the complete model-tier routing plan and authorized implementation, deployment and a bounded live pilot. Work item S2.\n\n## Task\nMaintainer-implemented change to protected .relay/** and .github/workflows/**. Set defaults medium, implement-issue from issue, review/fix/recovery/triage high, merge from linked issue with explicit unlinked high. Pin the bot revision that enforces execution cache identity. Preserve trigger, priority, quality gate, time and round contracts. Deploy compatible Relay before merging new syntax into develop.\n\n## Touches\n- .relay/config.yml\n- .relay/workflows/*.md\n- .github/workflows/code-review.yml\n\n## Scope\n### In scope\nThe mechanism above, its failure-path tests and necessary documentation.\n### Out of scope\nPer-step model selection, automatic cross-tier fallback, new budget infrastructure and unrelated cleanup.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- All six workflows validate on the deployed Relay and choose the intended tier. Bot pin is immutable. Protected changes are not queued for Relay implementation.\n- Relevant local verification and CI pass before deployment.",
